!! Fold readiness — measured 2026-09-13, REPORTED and not executed

''Nobody lights this fire from here.'' `otakiage#/the-fire` rules it: //the operator CALLS it; any hand may carry it//. This slot measures what a FOLD would take, so the call rests on a reading rather than on a guess. Nothing below has been enacted; the only act this watch performed on this carrier was giving it its `lifecycle/standing` tag, dropping the two retired keys, and writing this measurement.

!!! THE BLOCKER CLEARED 2026-09-13 — slot 8 has a home

Seven of the eight slots had a carrier that inherited their ruling; slot 8 stood alone, its moʻolelo clause //one bundle, the caps decide what rings (operator)// recorded on this floor and nowhere else in the tree. A fold cannot re-point what nothing inherited.

''The ruling now stands whole at'' <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/recipe-layer-model">> ''`#/one-bundle`'' — quoted verbatim under quote license, with its three grounds, the bundle's measured shape at `lares-memetic-wikitext.json`, and what it leaves open — plus a ninth entry in that carrier's `#/questions` list and a `status-why` naming what it now holds. ''The home was read off the gradient, never off the path'': that carrier already carries the cap-decides-behaviour rulings this clause instantiates (`#/questions`: //the cap-stack falls to the floor, never reds//; //the daemon reads as a wiki with specific caps to the vessel//) and already inventories what the TW5 side ships (`#/tw5-surfaces`). `composable-keel#/absence-is-structural` holds the DOCTRINE the ruling leans on and gets cited rather than rewritten — it rules runtime composition, never a shipped artifact's contents.

''Every slot now has an inheritor.'' The blocker that stood before any weld stands cleared; what remains reads below, and none of it is a missing home.

